            <Pad Id="A41Z6fv78VFNzFCNysgscC" Bounds="1200,626,276,100" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="“STAIR”: All movement commands will be done telling spot that he might walk up or down stairs. The robot will ignore all movement commands except MOVE Forward/Backward when in STAIRS MODE. Furthermore, the velocity_speed parameter will be ignored and Spot will use a default speed (0.1 for backward, 0.2 for forward).&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;“DEFAULT”: The movement commands will be done in “AUTO” mode(internal name). Spot will decide which mode suits best. Usually, Spot uses the “TROT” mode.">
              <p:TypeAnnotation>
                <Choice Kind="TypeFlag" Name="String" />
              </p:TypeAnnotation>
              <p:ValueBoxSettings>
                <p:fontsize p:Type="Int32">5</p:fontsize>
                <p:stringtype p:Assembly="VL.Core" p:Type="VL.Core.StringType">Comment</p:stringtype>
              </p:ValueBoxSettings>
            </Pad>
