                      <p:stringtype p:Assembly="VL.Core" p:Type="VL.Core.StringType">Comment</p:stringtype>
                    </p:ValueBoxSettings>
                  </Pad>
                  <Pad Id="KDAEw8g6vklLfx43CzclQv" Bounds="-754,48,716,226" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="The groundContactNormalRtFrame vector describes the orientation of the contact surface at the foot—specifically, it is the unit-length normal of the terrain patch against which the foot is pressed, expressed “relative to” (Rt) the chosen reference frame (e.g. odom). In more concrete terms:&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Normal vector: A normal is a perpendicular direction to a surface. Here, it points straight “out” of the ground at the foot-contact point.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Unit length: The components (x, y, z) are scaled so that the vector’s overall magnitude is 1. That way, it encodes orientation only, not distance.">
                    <p:TypeAnnotation LastCategoryFullName="Primitive" LastDependency="VL.CoreLib.vl">
                      <Choice Kind="TypeFlag" Name="String" />
                    </p:TypeAnnotation>
                    <p:ValueBoxSettings>
                      <p:fontsize p:Type="Int32">9</p:fontsize>
                      <p:stringtype p:Assembly="VL.Core" p:Type="VL.Core.StringType">Comment</p:stringtype>
                    </p:ValueBoxSettings>
                  </Pad>
                  <Pad Id="ROwkCKEjHHTNC61DHve69j" Bounds="-754,255,709,80" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="GroundMuEst is simply Spot’s estimate of the ground’s coefficient of friction (μ), expressed as a dimensionless number.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;μ quantifies how “grippy” the contact surface is. A value of 0.6 means that the maximum tangential (sliding) force the foot can sustain is about 60 % of the normal (pressing) force.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Internally, the robot fuses force-torque readings, foot-slip measurements and contact normals to arrive at this estimate.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;">
                    <p:TypeAnnotation LastCategoryFullName="Primitive" LastDependency="VL.CoreLib.vl">
                      <Choice Kind="TypeFlag" Name="String" />
                    </p:TypeAnnotation>
                    <p:ValueBoxSettings>
                      <p:fontsize p:Type="Int32">9</p:fontsize>
                      <p:stringtype p:Assembly="VL.Core" p:Type="VL.Core.StringType">Comment</p:stringtype>
                    </p:ValueBoxSettings>
                  </Pad>
                  <Pad Id="TPhDlfgzH9WOmhLBJIwXZP" SlotId="FHjR6mJVqB5LuyaCqiRCw6" Bounds="229,192" />
